WEBVTT

00:00:05.063 --> 00:00:16.353
Open Reports turns application data into print-ready documents your team can customize and your application can render. Start at Home to explore examples, create a report, or find help.

00:00:17.735 --> 00:00:25.361
Choose a starter that is close to your work, or begin with a blank page. This invoice is a working example with fictional business data.

00:00:29.579 --> 00:00:40.071
In Design, arrange text, logos, tables and other report elements. Data shows the fields behind the sample, and the page settings control the printed size and layout.

00:00:43.654 --> 00:00:51.291
Preview renders the actual PDF so you can check how the report will look on paper. Export options depend on the output you choose.

00:00:56.965 --> 00:01:04.526
Save keeps an editable draft. Publishing follows validation and creates a version for your report viewer or application integration.

00:01:07.271 --> 00:01:13.043
Start with the designer tour and first-report lesson, then follow a focused video for the task you need.
